        "os and pathlib handle the machine: Path('data') / 'sales.csv' builds a path correctly on every operating system, Path.exists() checks before opening, and Path.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True) creates folders safely. Hard-coded C:\\ paths are the signature of code that only ever ran on one laptop.",
